  "description": "The high-performance, 100% offline financial validation toolkit for .NET.\n\n\t  Features:\n\t  ✔️ IBAN Validation: Specific rules for Belgium, Netherlands, France, Germany, UK, and Luxembourg.\n\t  ✔️ Payment Cards: Zero-allocation Luhn algorithm check, brand detection.\n\t  ✔️ Payment References: Generate/Validate Belgian OGM/VCS and ISO 11649 (RF).\n\t  ✔️ Structure: BIC/SWIFT format validation.\n\n\t  Designed for FinTechs and SaaS. Zero dependencies.\n\t  Compatible with .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
